                                "sense_id": "4d616684-1ee6-300d-9f0d-49a06ea0f905",
                                "text": "Sometimes the Princess was seen conferring spiritedly with the Spongiatosta security details posted about the streets nearby, whose livery bore the ancient family arms, a sponge couchant on a field chequy with flames at the foot."
